            "description": "",
            "summary": "Snow and ice equipment company Douglas Dynamics (NYSE:PLOW) fell short of the markets revenue expectations in Q3 CY2025, but sales rose 25.3% year on year to $162.1 million. On the other hand, the company\u2019s full-year revenue guidance of $647.5 million at the midpoint came in 1.3% above analysts\u2019 estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $0.40 per share was in line with analysts\u2019 consensus estimates.",
